      <guid>https://tamada.github.io/sibling/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;:memo: Changelog&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;memo-changelog&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#memo-changelog&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/tamada/sibling/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;CHANGELOG.md&lt;/a&gt; in the repository.&#xA;Note that v3.0.0 changed the meaning of the &lt;code&gt;DIR&lt;/code&gt; argument, the exit status, and the utility commands of the shell.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;:scroll: License&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;scroll-license&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#scroll-license&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/tamada/sibling/blob/main/LICENSE&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;WTFPL&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;:+1: Commercial use&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;:+1: Modification&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;:+1: Distribution&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;:+1: Private use&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;:man_office_worker: Developers :woman_office_worker:&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;man_office_worker-developers-woman_office_worker&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#man_office_worker-developers-woman_office_worker&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://tamada.github.io&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Haruaki Tamada&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;:link: Useful links for directory traversing&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;link-useful-links-for-directory-traversing&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#link-useful-links-for-directory-traversing&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/ajeetdsouza/zoxide&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;zoxide&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A smarter cd command. Supports all major shells.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/cbxbiker61/cdargs&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;cdargs&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Directory bookmarking system - Enhanced cd utilities&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://superuser.com/questions/299694/is-there-a-directory-history-for-bash&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Is there a directory history for bash?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
